[00:27.38]Please judge me, Lord, observe my loyalty;
[00:35.10]Observe my trust in you and my integrity.
[00:43.97]Examine me, and put me to the test;
[00:51.76]My mind and heart refine, that my soul might be blessed.
[01:02.25](Chorus)
[01:02.40]But as for me, Determined I will be
[01:10.60]to walk eternally In my integrity.
[01:25.24]I do not sit with wicked men of lies.
[01:32.62]I hate the company of those who truth despise.
[01:41.80]Jehovah, please, don’t take away my life
[01:49.02]With men who take delight in bribery and strife.
[02:00.01](Chorus)
[02:00.16]But as for me, Determined I will be
[02:07.32]to walk eternally In my integrity.
[02:17.46]For I have loved the dwelling of your house.
[02:21.36]Your worship, oh, so pure, I daily will espouse.
[02:52.65]And I will march around your altar grand,
[03:00.15]To make thanksgiving heard aloud throughout the land.
[03:10.74](Chorus)
[03:10.89]But as for me, Determined I will be
[03:18.47]to walk eternally In my integrity.
